		""
		"&5▌ Main changes"
		"&f- Added a large number of KJS scripts and adjusted some recipes and game mechanics."
		"&f- Added some exclusive machines and items."
		"&f- The mission system has been rearranged to adapt to the enhanced content."
		""
		"&5▌ Precautions"
		"&f- Some content is still being adjusted, and there may be recipe changes or balance issues."
		"&f- If you have any questions, please report them in the corresponding communication group."
