			description: [
		"&6&l» Island expansion tool"
		"&f- It can automatically identify and fill blocks of &a1×1 &for &a3×3 &f. It is a very useful helper for island expansion."
		""
		"&6&l» How to operate"
		"&f- Use &estick &for &ewrench &fto adjust the pattern."
		"&f- Hold the controller close to the platform block to display the expanded preview."
		"&f- Right-click on the platform block while standing to switch platform types."
		"&f- Right-click the platform block while sneaking to switch whether to fill it up and down."
		"&f- Right-click the platform block with any stone in hand to expand the platform according to the current settings."
		""
		"&4&l» Important warning"
		"&c- Before unfolding the platform, please be sure to confirm the filling direction!"
		"&c- When filled, it directly destroys and replaces all blocks in that direction."
		"&c- It is recommended to sneak right-click with a wrench or wooden stick to switch the mode to:"
		"&a- \"The blocks above the platform will remain\" &cfor safety reasons."
	]
