		{
			dependencies: ["6A7BE998C2EC882D"]
			description: [
		"&f- Handheld terminal &6Sneak right click &fMulti-block host: &aautomatically builds the &fstructure."
		"&f- &dRight-click &fMulti-block console: &aShow preview of &f."
		"&f- The terminal can recognize the &fblocks in the &bexquisite backpack (the backpack cannot be placed in the accessories slot)."
		""
		"&6&l» Building suggestions"
		"&c- There are a few problems with automatic construction. It is recommended to put only the structural blocks in the backpack first, and then automatically place the functional warehouse after the main body is automatically built."
		"&f- &bThe warehouse-less mode &fis very useful, but you need to right-click and open the GUI every time you enter the archive before it will take effect."
		""
		"&6&l» Repeating structure"
		"&f- Set the number of repeated structures of &eto &f, which is suitable for multi-block structures that can be stacked in multiple layers, such as distillation towers. The larger the value, the longer the structure."
		""
		"&6&l» Advanced terminal expansion"
		"&f- Supports &bto replace &fcoils, space elevator power modules, component assembly line housings and stellar thermal vessels (click the \"level square\" text to open the selection interface)."
		"&f- Supports &bmirror placement and &fmulti-block structure. At this time, the warehouse-free mode continues to take effect."
		""
		"&4&l» Demolition Warning"
		"&c- In the demolition mode, you need to dismantle and close it once, otherwise there will be samples all over the floor, so be careful!"
		""
		"&6&l» Practical Tips"
		"&f- &6Shift+right click &fUnlimited access to nodes, which can directly extract items and fluids from the AE network during construction, especially useful for multi-block structures that require water."
	]
